# From build 132 on, built apps, archives and PDFs are published as GitHub Releases (see RELEASING.md), not committed.
# Note: .gitignore only affects files that aren't tracked yet. The build-131 files already in Windows/, Android/, Mac/,
# Web/, Guides/ and Reports/ stay tracked until the owner approves removing them from future commits.
*.exe
*.apk
*.aab
*.zip
*.dmg
*.pdf
*.part[0-9]*
*.[0-9][0-9][0-9]
staging/
dist/
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
